Scope of this license

The MIT terms above cover the source code in this repository, which was
written from scratch for this project.

They do not, and cannot, grant any rights in the game *Tank Trouble* itself.
This repository is an unofficial, non-commercial reimplementation of that
game's mechanics, created for research and coursework. It is not affiliated
